{"type": "mcq", "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"4 x squared minus 5 x minus 5 equals 0\"><mrow>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mn>4</mn>\n\t\t\t<msup>\n\t\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t\t\t<mn>2</mn>\n\t\t\t</msup>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mn>5</mn>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t\t<mn>5</mn>\n\t</mrow>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mn>0</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">What is the greatest solution to the given equation?</p>", "keys": ["03ced578-4897-4ab0-b71d-562ec5167b8a"], "answerOptions": [{"id": "6d5e35c0-b3ab-4d66-8862-d1b6be07ede7", "content": "<p><math alttext=\"five eighths minus StartFraction StartRoot 105 EndRoot Over 8 EndFraction\"><mfrac>\n\t<mn>5</mn>\n\t<mn>8</mn>\n</mfrac>\n<mo>-</mo><mrow>\n\t<mfrac>\n\t\t<msqrt>\n\t\t\t<mn>105</mn>\n\t\t</msqrt>\n\t\t<mn>8</mn>\n\t</mfrac>\n</mrow>\n</math></p>"}, {"id": "03ced578-4897-4ab0-b71d-562ec5167b8a", "content": "<p><math alttext=\"five eighths plus StartFraction StartRoot 105 EndRoot Over 8 EndFraction\"><mfrac>\n\t<mn>5</mn>\n\t<mn>8</mn>\n</mfrac>\n<mo>+</mo><mrow>\n\t<mfrac>\n\t\t<msqrt>\n\t\t\t<mn>105</mn>\n\t\t</msqrt>\n\t\t<mn>8</mn>\n\t</mfrac>\n</mrow>\n</math></p>"}, {"id": "56514907-c738-42f5-a0f6-56cbc621714d", "content": "<p><math alttext=\"five fourths minus StartFraction StartRoot 105 EndRoot Over 4 EndFraction\"><mfrac>\n\t<mn>5</mn>\n\t<mn>4</mn>\n</mfrac>\n<mo>-</mo><mrow>\n\t<mfrac>\n\t\t<msqrt>\n\t\t\t<mn>105</mn>\n\t\t</msqrt>\n\t\t<mn>4</mn>\n\t</mfrac>\n</mrow>\n</math>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": "249b0679-74c1-480a-9cb0-c845fb69b6b2", "content": "<p><math alttext=\"five fourths plus StartFraction StartRoot 105 EndRoot Over 4 EndFraction\"><mfrac>\n\t<mn>5</mn>\n\t<mn>4</mn>\n</mfrac>\n<mo>+</mo><mrow>\n\t<mfrac>\n\t\t<msqrt>\n\t\t\t<mn>105</mn>\n\t\t</msqrt>\n\t\t<mn>4</mn>\n\t</mfrac>\n</mrow>\n</math>&nbsp;</p>"}], "rationale": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice B is correct. The solutions to a quadratic equation of the form <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"a x squared plus b x plus c equals 0\"><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"a\"><mi>a</mi></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"b\"><mi>b</mi></math>, and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"c\"><mi>c</mi></math> are constants, can be calculated using the quadratic formula <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"x equals StartFraction negative b plus or minus StartRoot b squared minus 4 a c EndRoot Over 2 a EndFraction\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>&#177;</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>. The given equation is of this form, where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"a equals 4\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"b equals negative 5\"><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></math>, and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"c equals negative 5\"><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></math>. Substituting these values into the quadratic formula yields <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"x equals StartFraction minus left parenthesis negative 5 right parenthesis plus or minus StartRoot left parenthesis negative 5 right parenthesis squared minus 4 left parenthesis 4 right parenthesis left parenthesis negative 5 right parenthesis EndRoot Over 2 left parenthesis 4 right parenthesis EndFraction\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#177;</mo><msqrt><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfrac></math>, or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"x equals StartFraction 5 plus or minus StartRoot 25 plus 80 EndRoot Over 8 EndFraction\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>&#177;</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>25</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>80</mn></mrow></msqrt></mrow><mn>8</mn></mfrac></math>. These solutions can be rewritten as <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"x equals StartFraction 5 plus or minus StartRoot 105 EndRoot Over 8 EndFraction\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>&#177;</mo><msqrt><mn>105</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>8</mn></mfrac></math>, or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"x equals five eighths plus or minus StartFraction StartRoot 105 EndRoot Over 8 EndFraction\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mo>&#177;</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>105</mn></msqrt><mn>8</mn></mfrac></math>. Since&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"five eighths plus StartFraction StartRoot 105 EndRoot Over 8 EndFraction\"><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>105</mn></msqrt><mn>8</mn></mfrac></math> is greater than&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"five eighths minus StartFraction StartRoot 105 EndRoot Over 8 EndFraction\"><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>105</mn></msqrt><mn>8</mn></mfrac></math>, it follows that the greatest solution to the given equation is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"five eighths plus StartFraction StartRoot 105 EndRoot Over 8 EndFraction\"><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>105</mn></msqrt><mn>8</mn></mfrac></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice A is incorrect. This is the least, not the greatest, solution to the given equation.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice C is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice D is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>", "externalid": "ccdcaf2a-7d93-4de9-b26e-676ccc65d3d4", "correct_answer": ["B"]}